  m_functionName: 
  m_description: "Returns SRP's additional lights information calculated with the
    selected lighting mode. Shadow mask option only applied on SRP 14 or greater.
    Forward rendering only.\n\nRGB: Returns the colored shade value (color * intensity)\n\n\rColor:
    Returns the shade color\n\nIntensity: Returns the shade intensity"
